{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>He shall bring it near.</b> A verb name [verbal noun], and the sense is 'the sons of Aaron shall bring it near'; like 'one of the sons of Aaron' (Leviticus 6:7) — therefore 'and he shall elevate from it.' And this section was added onto what is written in the section of 'And He called.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:45.255470211Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}